      "value": "related:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/created-too-many-sessions-for-that-user\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/no-reason-phrase-created-too-many-sessions-for-that-user\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/too-many-request-account-error\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/logging-in-from-too-many-places-message-on-vpn-users",
